{
  "description": "How Doopi & Friends episodes are upgraded from version 2 to version 3 scripts (tools/upgrade_v3.mjs). These are the settings Sridhar approved on episode 1 (2026-10-21): natural pacing, camera glides instead of cuts, bendy limbs, Piper voices with lip-sync, voice ducking, and lighting by place and time of day.",
